; M101 — work area soft limits: X MIN_LIMIT = [AXIS_X]MIN_LIMIT.
; Remapped in biber3ax.ini: REMAP = M101 modalgroup=10 ngc=m101
; Clears motion.digital-out-08 (mux2 tc-x-min-limit -> ini.*.min_limit,
; postgui.hal). Also called by toolchange.ngc; on_abort.ngc clears it too.
; The dwell + M66 queue buster let task apply the limit before more moves
; are queued.

o<m101> sub
  M65 P8
  G4 P0.2
  M66 P2 L0
o<m101> endsub
M2
